1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,838
They took... everything.

2
00:00:03,408 --> 00:00:05,599
We don't even have a sale.

3
00:00:05,639 --> 00:00:08,442
Restock... after a nap.

4
00:00:12,362 --> 00:00:15,478
The shelves!
They're full!

5
00:00:16,398 --> 00:00:19,242
Every label... faces front.

6
00:00:19,282 --> 00:00:22,204
Pip. Did you restock
in your sleep?

7
00:00:22,244 --> 00:00:25,282
No... it was magic!

8
00:00:25,852 --> 00:00:27,390
You're welcome!

9
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:29,122
You don't have hands.

10
00:00:29,162 --> 00:00:30,841
...Details.

11
00:00:30,911 --> 00:00:33,557
Thank you, whoever you are!

12
00:00:35,627 --> 00:00:37,646
...They're shy.
